# Hollowpick Quarry (CIPlay vi_hollowpick_quarry): quest "Payday in the Pit" (8 steps)
# The pit (6 -2, 3 m), the office cabin x -16..-11.5 z -15..-12 (5 m), the wagons on x 6 z -12..-29, the powder
# keypad at -18 4 (6 m), the crane generator at 9 -33 and the hoist crate at 8.5 -41 (yard 2 m). offset: set in phase 2.
island Hollowpick Quarry
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Payday in the Pit
wait 5
expect animals Rat 4
expect hidden powderstore
expect hidden hoistcrate
zone quarry_pit
expect step 1
read Shift ledger
expect step 2
kill Rat
expect step 3
read Chalk on wagon 3
expect step 4
code powderpad 247 wrong
expect hidden powderstore
code powderpad 274
expect shown powderstore
expect story powderopen 1
expect step 5
use cranegen
expect hidden hoistcrate
open Powder store
wait 3
expect story raft-Tangaroa_GeneratorPart 1
expect step 6
use cranegen
expect shown hoistcrate
expect story craneup 1
expect step 7
open Hoist crate
expect done
